&#160;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">0.10 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Special_event_items\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Special event items\">Special event items</a></b>, must own a Founder's Account - see tips\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/False_Life_(enchantment)#Lesser_False_Life\" title=\"False Life (enchantment)\">Lesser False Life</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/False_Life_(enchantment)#Lesser_False_Life\" title=\"False Life (enchantment)\">Lesser False Life</a>:</b> This item grants the wearer +5 maximum <a href=\"/page/Hit_point\" title=\"Hit point\">health</a>.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Founder%27s_Helm.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Founder%27s_Helm.png/420px-Founder%27s_Helm.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"222\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Founder%27s_Helm.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#DDAAFF\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EEDDFF\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><i>This helm commemorates the Founding of Stormreach, the day that the <a href=\"/page/Coin_Lords\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Coin Lords\">Coin Lords</a> first allowed adventurers free run of the city.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p>\n<ul><li><span style=\"background-color: initial; color: #FF0000;\"><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: inherit;\"><i>This item cannot be fed to <a href=\"/page/Sentient_Weapon\" title=\"Sentient Weapon\">sentient jewels</a>.</i></span></span></li>\n<li>This helm is only available to characters whose account had a character in a guild of at least 10 people by the end of the Head Start Beta Event. It's a thank you to all of our preorder customers for participating in the Head Start Event.</li>\n<li>This item automatically spawns in the character inventory upon creation, and will spawn on all new characters made on this account.</li>\n<li>In addition to this helm, Founders were given two other bonuses:\n<ul><li>A special forum account title, and if desired - founder only forum avatar</li>\n<li>Their character's name from beta was written on the founders fountain added in the game in <a href=\"/page/Module_1\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Module 1\">Module 1</a>.</li></ul></li></ul>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817044054\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.068 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.130 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3193/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 21632/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6219/2097152 bytes\nH